ns, holy-day celebrations, and recitals.","source_url":"https://www.smu.edu/perkins/about/chapel","source_title":"Perkins Chapel: A Chapel for the 21st Century | SMU Perkins School of Theology","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The chapel hosts worship and other scheduled activities; confirm availability before entering.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"smu-mcfarlin-memorial-auditorium","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"McFarlin Memorial Auditorium","title":"Check what is on at McFarlin","subtitle":"Sunday afternoon · 6405 Boaz Lane","notes":"Look at the upcoming calendar, then choose a future performance or talk that interests you rather than trying to fill every first-weekend hour.","short_summary":"Get familiar with a historic performance venue and its event calendar.","evidence_claim":"McFarlin Memorial Auditorium is listed on the National Register of Historic Places and hosts performances by vocalists, comedians, bands, and dance companies.","source_url":"https://www.smu.edu/businessfinance/campusservices/mcfarlin","source_title":"McFarlin Memorial Auditorium | SMU","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Event access and ticket requirements vary; consult the listing for the specific program.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"smu-owen-arts-center","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Owen Arts Center","title":"Finish in the arts complex","subtitle":"Sunday afternoon · 6101 Bishop Boulevard","notes":"Walk the building’s public areas, note the galleries and performance spaces, and pick one future screening, exhibit, or performance to revisit.","short_summary":"End the weekend by mapping SMU’s dance, music, theatre, and visual-arts home.","evidence_